OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife conservation cash targets
OL,4,Aex-colliery sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FPonds are to be restored and freshwater
OL,7,Fhabitats created for amphibians and
OL,8,Freptiles at two former colliery sites
OL,9,Fin South Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe Froglife charity has been awarded
OL,12,Fnearly #890,000 of Lottery cash to
OL,13,Fcarry out the work in Rother Valley, as
OL,14,Fwell as at sites in North and West
OL,15,FYorkshire.
OL,17,FKiveton and Dinnington Community
OL,18,FWoodlands were originally regenerated
OL,19,Fthrough the National Coalfields
OL,20,FProgramme after the pits there closed
OL,21,Fin the 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
