OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife conservation cash targets
OL,4,Aex-colliery sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheila Grundry, from Froglife, said
OL,7,Fstaff were "delighted" to work in the
OL,8,Farea because "freshwater will make a
OL,9,Flasting difference for frogs and other
OL,10,Fwildlife and it's a great way for local
OL,11,Fpeople to learn new skills".
